tom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Geguang Pu<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">East China Normal University, China</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/fse-2026/fse-2026-research-papers/122/Understanding-Detecting-and-Repairing-Real-World-In-Context-Learning-Based-Text-to-\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-da02edd6-0f6d-4cad-a595-76d2d819985e').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
